  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency-Anticipatory actions to support farmers? resilience impacted by low rains in Rwanda</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to improving food security for households expected to face the impacts of the combined shocks (drought plus high food and input prices). Through the measures proposed, particularly irrigation, the capacities of households and communities will be strengthened to mitigate the impacts of the forecast below-average rains from October to December 2022.</narrative>
  </description>
